theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
text = "PC CONTROLS:
• WASD / Arrow Keys: Move character
• Left Click / Space: Sword combo attack
• 1 / 2 / 3: Cast Skills (Fire, Dash, Power Strike)
• Q: Drink Healing Potion (restores 30 HP)
• E: Interact (Shops, NPCs, Portals, Save Point)
• ESC: Pause Menu

MOBILE / TOUCH CONTROLS:
• Left Joystick: Move adventurer
• Right Swipe Area: Rotate 3D Camera smoothly
• Bottom Right Buttons: Attack combo & Skills (1, 2, 3)
• Top Right: Pause menu & Quick Potion
• Contextual Interact: Appears near NPCs, shops, altars"

